NOTE ON CONTENT AND ART

This license covers the source code only.

- Character art in images/ includes third-party characters used here for private,
  personal, non-commercial purposes only. Those characters remain the property of
  their respective owners. If you fork this for public or commercial use, remove
  them and ship only art you own or are licensed to use. The game runs on built-in
  emoji avatars with no images at all.
- Practice problems: the math problems are original, generated by the code and
  inspired by common Grade 4 topics. They are not affiliated with, endorsed by,
  or reproduced from any commercial curriculum.
